  "name": "Atul Kochhul Soft Shell Crab",
  "text": "Atul Kochhul Soft Shell Crab\n\nPreparation Time: 5 minutes\n\nCooking time: 2 minutes\n\nYield: 1\n\nIngredients\n\n2 soft shell crabs,\n\n1 tsp turmeric,\n\n1 tsp ground coriander,\n\n1 tsp mango powder,\n\n1/2 tsp red chilli powder,\n\n2 tbsp mustard oil,\n\n1/2 lime (juice only),\n\n3/4 tbsp cornflour,\n\n3/4 tbsp rice flour,\n\nlight green salad.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Put into a mixing bowl: 1 tsp turmeric, 1 tsp ground coriander, 1 tsp mango powder, 1/2 tsp red chilli powder, 2 tbsp mustard oil, the juice of 1/2 lime, salt, 3/4 tbsp cornflour, 3/4 tbsp rice flour. Mix well. If the paste is too thick add a little more oil to form a gluey paste.\n\n2. Coat the crabs with the past by holding the crab in one hand, and massaging in the mixture with the other.\n\n3. Deep fry for 2 minutes.\n\n4. Serve with a light green salad.",
  "prepTime": "PT5M",
  "cookTime": "PT2M",
  "recipeYield": "1",
